{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Write batches of records in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, for an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"text":" to send.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/collectorencoding"]}],"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"CollectorEncoding","modules":[{"name":"CollectorEncoding"}],"title":"CollectorEncoding","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatch"],"title":"Encoding batches","anchor":"Encoding-batches"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/SkippedRecord","doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorEncodingError"],"title":"Records left out","anchor":"Records-left-out"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the "},{"code":"BatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a self-hosted TraffluentCollector’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"POST \/v1\/batches","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Give it to an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") as its encoder,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and pass the collector’s API key to the destination as an "},{"code":"Authorization: Bearer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" header field."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The body is JSON: one object per record, with the record’s identifier (which a redelivered record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps), the event’s name, its timestamp, whether it is redelivered, its properties and its context.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Properties are read from the event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryCodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" form, which ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" derives, through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event’s schema in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"TrackingPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the encoder is made with. The context holds the standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context keys the record has values for, its session and sample rate, and its trace context. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value is written only while the record reveals it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A record the encoder can’t write is left out and the rest of the batch is sent: one whose event and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"version the plan doesn’t describe, one whose event isn’t ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryCodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one holding a value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"JSON can’t, such as a NaN. Each is logged; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)"},{"text":" returns the body","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with each record left out as a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/SkippedRecord"},{"text":". When no record of a batch can be written,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/encode(_:)"},{"text":" throws, and the destination sends nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To send to a server of your own format, write a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" of your own. To send to PostHog,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PostHogBatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PostHogEncoding"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import CollectorEncoding","import HTTPDestinations","import TrackingPlans","","let plan = TrackingPlan(schemas: [SignedUp.schema])","let encoder = CollectorBatchEncoder(plan: plan)","let collector = HTTPDestination(","    endpoint: collectorURL,  \/\/ https:\/\/collector.example.com\/v1\/batches","    headerFields: [.authorization: \"Bearer \\(apiKey)\"],","    encoder: encoder)","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: collector)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers sending to the collector beside the other destinations."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatchEncoder/encode(_:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatchencoder\/encode(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/encode(_: